OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and wet during the
OL,6,Fmorning with occasionally heavy bouts
OL,7,Fof rain. Drier and brighter periods by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, but it will be breezy
OL,9,Fand feel fairly chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy but dry start to the
OL,12,Fevening ahead of a band of rain and
OL,13,Fshowers arriving from the west by the
OL,14,Fmorning. Winds becoming light and
OL,15,Fvariable.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FChangeable, with periods of
OL,18,Fsunshine and showers, some of which
OL,19,Fmaybe heavy with hail and thunder.
OL,20,FWinds light but gusty beneath showers
OL,21,Fand breezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
