OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter on Thursday after early
OL,7,Fshowers. Largely dry Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday with fog patches forming
OL,9,Fovernight under clearing skies.
OL,10,FTemperatures around normal.
